        "Easton.",
        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>RAAMAH</strong> thunder. (1.) One of the sons of Cush (Genesis 10:7). (2.) A country which traded with Tyre (Ezekiel 27:22).",
        "Easton's Illustrated Bible Dictionary, M. G. Easton (1897). Public domain.",
