        "Easton.",
        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>JOBAB</strong> dweller in the desert. (1.) One of the sons of Joktan, and founder of an Arabian tribe (Genesis 10:29). (2.) King of Edom, succeeded Bela (Genesis 36:33, 34). (3.) A Canaanitish king (Joshua 11:1) who joined the confederacy against Joshua.",
        "Easton's Illustrated Bible Dictionary, M. G. Easton (1897). Public domain.",
