        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>BITUMEN</strong> Genesis 11:3, R.V., margin, rendered in the A.V. “slime”), a mineral pitch. With this the ark was pitched (6:14. See also Exodus 2:3.) (See SLIME.)",
