        "dict-easton",
        "Dictionary",
        "Easton.",
        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>AMMON</strong> another form of the name Ben-ammi, the son of Lot (Genesis 19:38). This name is also used for his posterity (Psalm 83:7).",
        "Easton's Illustrated Bible Dictionary, M. G. Easton (1897). Public domain.",
