        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>KEMUEL</strong> helper of God, or assembly of God. (1.) The third son of Nahor (Genesis 22:21). (2.) Son of Shiphtan, appointed on behalf of the tribe of Ephraim to partition the land of Canaan (Numbers 34:24). (3.) A Levite (1 Chronicles 27:17).",
