        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>MAHALATH</strong> a lute; lyre. (1.) The daughter of Ishmael, and third wife of Esau (Genesis 28:9); called also Bashemath (Genesis 36:3). (2.) The daughter of Jerimoth, who was one of David’s sons. She was one of Rehoboam’s wives (2 Chronicles 11:18).",
