        "Easton.",
        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>PHAREZ</strong> breach, the elder of the twin sons of Judah (Genesis 38:29). From him the royal line of David sprang (Ruth 4:18-22). “The chief of all the captains of the host” was of the children of Perez (1 Chronicles 27:3; Matthew 1:3).",
