        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>HEBER</strong> passing over. (1.) Son of Beriah and grandson of Asher (Genesis 46:17; 1 Chronicles 7:31, 32). (2.) The Kenite (Judges 4:11, 17; 5:24), a descendant of Hobab. His wife Jael received Sisera (q.v.) into her tent and then killed him. (3.) 1 Chronicles 4:18. (4.) A Benjamite (1 Chronicles 8:17). (5.) A Gadite (5:13). (See EBER.)",
        "Easton's Illustrated Bible Dictionary, M. G. Easton (1897). Public domain.",
